<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We want your journey with us to be smooth from start to finish, so I’m sorry to learn that you missed boarding on departure from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
Customer feedback told us that we were making too many announcements in the lounge, so we reduced the number of boarding calls in our domestic lounges to just one first and final call for each flight.<br />
<br />
Boarding times are printed on each customer’s boarding pass and displayed on departure boards throughout the terminal and our lounges. We do this to make sure customers have plenty of time to plan their walk to the gate in time for boarding.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
We’re committed to refining our procedures and taking any valuable feedback on board, so I’ve passed your comments on to our Airport Management in {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}}.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>